        },
        "description": "A typical highschooler with a charismatic and helpful nature, he lives with his Mother who has seperated from his Father due to marriage problems. Because if this seperation, Akiyuki is expected to take a prepared lunch to his father every morning, as well as keep the two&#039;s relationship running smoothly. He has two close friends, Haru and Furuichi.",
